WEBVTT

00:00:07.217 --> 00:00:08.844
Run!

00:00:08.927 --> 00:00:12.139
Don't you have anything better to do?
Whoa!

00:00:13.431 --> 00:00:14.683
SID:
Help!

00:00:15.642 --> 00:00:16.518
Sid?

00:00:16.601 --> 00:00:18.103
(Sid screaming weakly)

00:00:19.396 --> 00:00:21.439
(trudging footsteps) (trudging footsteps)

00:00:21.523 --> 00:00:24.192
(wind whooshing)

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:35.245
(echoing):
Sid must be down there.

00:00:35.328 --> 00:00:36.788
Well, he's dead.

00:00:36.872 --> 00:00:37.956
Real shame.

00:00:38.039 --> 00:00:40.333
He will be missed.

00:00:40.417 --> 00:00:41.751
ELLIE:
Oh, no, no, no, no.

00:00:41.835 --> 00:00:42.919
Not so fast.

00:00:43.003 --> 00:00:45.380
Okay, Ellie,
this is where I draw the line.

00:00:45.463 --> 00:00:48.216
You, Crash, and Eddie back to the village.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:49.718
Yeah, that's going to happen.

00:00:49.801 --> 00:00:50.719
Ellie...

00:00:50.802 --> 00:00:52.387
you saw that thing.

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:53.722
This is gonna be dangerous.

00:00:53.805 --> 00:00:55.348
Talk to the trunk.

00:00:55.432 --> 00:00:56.600
Oh, great.

00:00:56.683 --> 00:00:59.686
After we save Sid,
I'm going to kill him.

00:01:00.729 --> 00:01:01.688
Ladies first.

00:01:01.771 --> 00:01:02.939
Age before beauty.

00:01:03.023 --> 00:01:04.149
No pain, no gain.

00:01:04.232 --> 00:01:05.150
What pain?

00:01:05.233 --> 00:01:06.151
(grunts)

00:01:06.234 --> 00:01:07.152
(laughs)

00:01:07.235 --> 00:01:08.778
(gasps, screams)

00:01:16.077 --> 00:01:17.537
ELLIE:
Sid!

00:01:17.621 --> 00:01:18.788
CRASH:
Sid.

00:01:29.758 --> 00:01:31.927
Oh, no, no, no.

00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:34.304
Oh, not good, not good.

00:01:35.805 --> 00:01:36.765
Ellie.

00:01:36.848 --> 00:01:39.809
Ellie, wait up.

00:01:41.561 --> 00:01:42.646
Okay, look,

00:01:42.729 --> 00:01:45.148
if you feel anything,
even if it's nothing,

00:01:45.232 --> 00:01:47.651
you got to tell me and
then we're out of here.

00:01:47.734 --> 00:01:48.735
Okay.

00:01:48.818 --> 00:01:50.612
Oh, we need a code word.

00:01:50.695 --> 00:01:54.032
Yeah, something that says
"The baby's coming."

00:01:54.115 --> 00:01:57.786
Hmm, how about...
"Aah, the baby's coming!"?

00:01:57.869 --> 00:01:58.870
How's that?

00:01:58.954 --> 00:02:00.497
Eh, too long.

00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:04.459
We, we need something
short and punchy like, uh... "peaches."

00:02:04.542 --> 00:02:05.460
Peaches?

00:02:05.543 --> 00:02:06.962
I love peaches.

00:02:07.045 --> 00:02:11.216
They-They're sweet
and round and fuzzy, just like you.

00:02:11.299 --> 00:02:12.467
You think I'm round?

00:02:12.550 --> 00:02:14.052
Uh...

00:02:14.135 --> 00:02:15.387
round is good.

00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:18.640
Round is foxy.

00:02:19.641 --> 00:02:22.143
(Crash and Eddie shuddering)

00:02:28.733 --> 00:02:31.361
MANNY:
Stay close.

00:02:33.488 --> 00:02:35.824
(slithering)

00:02:45.583 --> 00:02:48.628
♪ ♪

00:02:49.629 --> 00:02:51.548
(dinosaur grunts)

00:02:51.631 --> 00:02:53.883
Are you guys having
the same dream I am?

00:02:53.967 --> 00:02:56.553
ELLIE: We've been living
above an entire world,

00:02:56.636 --> 00:02:59.264
and we didn't even know it.

00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:02.267
(dinosaurs grunting)

00:03:02.350 --> 00:03:04.477
(pterosaurs squawking)

00:03:08.148 --> 00:03:10.984
(squawking)

00:03:16.239 --> 00:03:17.115
Huh?

00:03:17.198 --> 00:03:18.533
-(loud thud)
-(yelling)

00:03:18.616 --> 00:03:20.577
(growls)

00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:21.870
(roars)

00:03:21.953 --> 00:03:23.330
Run for it!

00:03:23.413 --> 00:03:24.748
-Hurry!
-(dinosaur roars)

00:03:24.831 --> 00:03:26.207
(both scream)

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:27.709
(Diego growls)

00:03:28.251 --> 00:03:29.502
Whoa.

00:03:29.586 --> 00:03:31.796
(grunting)

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:33.923
Diego, w-what are you doing here?

00:03:34.007 --> 00:03:35.342
Sightseeing.

00:03:35.425 --> 00:03:37.093
Looking for Sid, same as you.

00:03:37.177 --> 00:03:39.012
Well, aren't you noble?

00:03:39.095 --> 00:03:40.430
This is not the time, guys.

00:03:40.513 --> 00:03:42.640
We need all the help we can get.

00:03:44.934 --> 00:03:45.935
(gasps)

00:03:48.646 --> 00:03:49.731
(roars)

00:03:49.814 --> 00:03:50.857
(roars louder)

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:52.359
(stammering)

00:03:52.442 --> 00:03:53.485
Aah!

00:03:53.568 --> 00:03:54.402
Never mind.

00:03:54.486 --> 00:03:57.989
(growling)

00:03:58.073 --> 00:03:59.032
(gasps)

00:04:01.951 --> 00:04:04.788
(gasping)

00:04:04.871 --> 00:04:06.373
Here, boy, here.

00:04:06.456 --> 00:04:09.000
-Come on. Good boy, come on.
-(dinosaur moaning)

00:04:09.084 --> 00:04:10.085
Climb on.

00:04:10.168 --> 00:04:11.211
Are you nuts?

00:04:11.294 --> 00:04:12.504
We're not getting on that thing.

00:04:12.587 --> 00:04:15.507
It's either this dinosaur or that one.

00:04:17.675 --> 00:04:18.510
(snarls)

00:04:18.593 --> 00:04:19.594
Pregnant lady wants to live.

00:04:19.677 --> 00:04:20.512
(grunts)

00:04:20.595 --> 00:04:22.555
Yabba-dabba-doo...!

00:04:22.639 --> 00:04:24.641
(dinosaur growls, Manny yelps)

00:04:24.724 --> 00:04:25.725
(grunts)

00:04:26.893 --> 00:04:28.520
-Whoa!
-(Manny grunting)

00:04:29.854 --> 00:04:31.147
(both screaming)

00:04:31.231 --> 00:04:33.233
(Diego and Manny grunt)

00:04:33.316 --> 00:04:36.277
Don't ever yabba-dabba-do that again.

00:04:39.406 --> 00:04:42.158
(rumbling, growls in distance)

00:04:42.242 --> 00:04:44.744
I feel so... puny.

00:04:44.828 --> 00:04:46.663
How do you think I feel?

00:04:46.746 --> 00:04:47.622
(low grunting)

00:04:47.705 --> 00:04:51.167
(horn blowing)

00:04:54.254 --> 00:04:55.630
(gibbering)

00:04:55.713 --> 00:04:57.090
(screams)

00:04:58.842 --> 00:05:00.176
-(thud)
-Ow.

00:05:02.804 --> 00:05:04.889
(growling)

00:05:05.348 --> 00:05:06.933
Aha!

00:05:07.016 --> 00:05:08.309
(grunting)

00:05:10.437 --> 00:05:12.397
Take cover!

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:14.023
(whooshing thud)

00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:18.486
(low grunting)

00:05:22.824 --> 00:05:25.452
(pterosaurs screeching)

00:05:27.245 --> 00:05:30.457
(low grunting)

00:05:34.919 --> 00:05:37.046
(exclaims excitedly)

00:05:38.047 --> 00:05:39.174
(sniffs)

00:05:39.257 --> 00:05:40.508
(disapproving grunt)

00:05:40.592 --> 00:05:41.843
(murmurs)

00:05:41.926 --> 00:05:44.053
(groans)

00:05:47.015 --> 00:05:49.934
(murmurs)

